<Placemark><name>153 · Kamakura: Tsurugaoka Hachimangu</name><description><![CDATA[<b>Kultur</b><br/>Der zentrale Schrein der Kamakura-Zeit, am Ende der Hauptallee<br/><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=35.3259856,139.5563462&query_place_id=ChIJiaqQeLhFGGARtTZQEBCtZ6g">In Google Maps öffnen</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#kultur</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>139.5563462,35.3259856,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
